# Wisp runtime state. Everything Wisp writes lives in ~/.moe (and ~/.wispair on
# the Air node), never in the repo — these patterns are belt-and-braces in case
# a WISP_HOME override or a stray test run points somewhere inside the checkout.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
audit.jsonl
grants.json
profile.md
profile.json
config.yaml

# Local model/debug dumps
wisp-debug-*.json
wisp-debug-*.txt
wisp-profile-*.md
